    ["description"] = "The campaign is a special tutorial missions under the F/A-18C Rising Squall Campaign DLC. It will take you from shallow to deep to be familiar with many basic functions and methods of using F/A-18C Hornet. The tutorial is based on the INVERTED world under Rising Squall and some contents have been modified and simplified relative to the ED official tutorials for beginners.  Therefore, this tutorial is not equivalent to the ED official tutorial, instead it focuses more on functions and application. In case of contradictions in some descriptions involved, the ED official tutorial shall prevail.",
